<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <title>Assignment 3 - Slay-Bags</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Segoe+UI:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background: url("your-background.jpg") no-repeat center center fixed;
      background-size: cover;
      color: #333;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0;
      width: 100%; height: 100%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
      z-index: -1;
    }
    header {
      background: linear-gradient(to right, deeppink, hotpink);
      padding: 40px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      color: white;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    }
    header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }
    header p {
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
    main {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    h2 {
      color: deeppink;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .text-paragraph {
      margin: 15px auto;
      font-size: 16px;
      text-align: justify;
    }
    #highlighted-paragraph {
      margin: 25px auto;
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: deeppink;
      background: #ffe6f2;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    #final-paragraph {
      margin: 25px auto;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-style: italic;
      color: purple;
    }
    .back-link {
      display: inline-block;
      background: deeppink;
      color: white;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-top: 30px;
      transition: background 0.3s;
    }
    .back-link:hover {
      background: black;
    }
    footer {
      background: linear-gradient(to right, pink, silver);
      padding: 20px;
      color: deeppink;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 40px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Slay-Bags</h1>
    <p>Luxury. Style. Confidence.</p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <h2>Importance of Our Site</h2>
    <p class="text-paragraph">
      Slay-Bags simplifies luxury shopping. Our site saves you time, ensures quality, and provides a trusted platform where style meets convenience. We bring together curated collections, transparent pricing, and a seamless shopping experience — making fashion accessible to everyone.
    </p>

    <p id="highlighted-paragraph">
      Why it matters: Slay-Bags is more than just a store. It’s a lifestyle hub where every purchase supports sustainable fashion and empowers local artisans. Shopping here means you’re part of something bigger.
    </p>

    <p class="text-paragraph">
      Our platform is designed with you in mind — intuitive navigation, secure checkout, and personalized recommendations ensure that your journey is smooth from start to finish.
    </p>

    <p class="text-paragraph">
      Customers consistently highlight how our site boosts their confidence in online shopping. With clear product details, reliable delivery, and responsive support, Slay-Bags sets the standard for luxury e-commerce.
    </p>

    <p id="final-paragraph">
      In short, Slay-Bags is where convenience meets elegance. Every click brings you closer to a bag that’s not just an accessory, but a statement of identity and purpose.
    </p>

    <a href="index.html" class="back-link">← Back to Home</a>
  </main>

  <footer>
    © 2026 Slay-Bags
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
